  "interpretation": "The finite five-camera H1 family has calibration-shared capacity under the frozen controlled proxy. v169 therefore failed because its low-frequency geometry objective chose inadequate subsets, not because every five-camera subset lacked capacity. The tightest passing margin is only 0.001047 at t=0.75, and truth is used offline to find witnesses, so this is objective-design headroom rather than a deployable algorithm.",
